{"id":"627232","name":"木瓜酸奶","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/627232/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"木瓜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"1500g"},{"name":"酸奶发酵剂","amount":"1份"}],"sub":[{"name":"酸奶干","amount":"几块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木瓜洗净。","img":"images/627232/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"滑蛋切开。","img":"images/627232/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去籽。","img":"images/627232/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"挖果球出来。","img":"images/627232/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"果球备用。","img":"images/627232/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"牛奶煮至45度左右。","img":"images/627232/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放酸奶发酵粉和白糖。","img":"images/627232/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/627232/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖盖子放酸奶机里。","img":"images/627232/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再盖外盖。","img":"images/627232/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"给电。","img":"images/627232/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小时酸奶做好。","img":"images/627232/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取酸奶干。","img":"images/627232/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把酸奶、果球喝酸奶干放在挖好的木瓜里即可。","img":"images/627232/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/627232/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：酸奶机\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}